[352.820923, "i", "ys do not override the autovacuum finding.\",\n\"T-17 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because autovacuum is false and checked first; the large class is computed from total_pages 1000, its bloat ratio is 0.40 over cap 0.2, and 50 stale stats days are not the finding.\",\n\"T-27 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because stats are stale for 46 days, so the large class computed from total_pages 1000 has a tightened cap of 0.15, and ratio 0.38 is over that effective cap.\",\n\"T-04 is STALE_STATISTICS because date math gives 45 stale days, ignoring the legacy days_since_analyze field; the large class computed from total_pages 1000 has ratio 0.10 under tightened cap 0.15, so staleness remains.\",\n\"T-21 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because manual vacuum overrides autovacuum even though enabled; the large class computed from total_pages 1000 has ratio 0.20 and cap 0.2, but the manual vacuum override is checked first.\",\n\"T-26 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED since stats are stale for 36 days, the large class computed from total_pages 1000 tightens cap t"]
