[352.822183, "i", "half-up makes the dead_pages/total_pages ratio 0.16 from 0.155, which is over the effective cap.\",\n\"T-10 is STALE_STATISTICS because date math gives 31 stale days, ignoring legacy days_since_analyze; its approved active reindex is valid, exempting the bloat check, but the large class computed from total_pages 1000 still has ratio 0.21 over cap 0.2.\",\n\"T-16 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because its reindex approval expired on 2026-08-25, so bloat applies; 31 stale days tighten the large cap computed from total_pages 1000 to 0.15, and ratio 0.20 is over that effective cap.\",\n\"T-19 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because the large class computed from total_pages 1000 has cap 0.2, and round-half-up makes the dead_pages/total_pages ratio 0.41 from 0.405, so it is over the cap.\",\n\"T-06 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because the large class computed from total_pages 1000 has ratio 0.25 over cap 0.2, with no stale stats or reindex exemption.\",\n\"T-14 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because the large class computed from total_pages"]
